{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38850","headline":"题瓦棺寺真上人院矮桧 · 杜荀鹤","name":"题瓦棺寺真上人院矮桧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天生仙桧是长材，栽桧希逢此最低。\n一自旧山来砌畔，几番凡木与云齐。\n回无斜影教僧踏，免有闲枝引鹤栖。\n今日偶题题似着，不知题後更谁题。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}